  "The Beaufort scale groups wind speeds by their effect, from calm at force 0 to hurricane force at 12, so a single number gives a sense of how the wind will feel and what it can move.": "蒲福風級依風的效應將風速分級，從 0 級無風到 12 級颶風，一個數字就能讓人了解風吹起來的感覺及其能吹動什麼。",
  "The Moon’s path around Earth isn’t a circle, so it drifts nearer and farther over the weeks. The figure here runs from the center of Earth to the center of the Moon at the moment shown, roughly 356,000 to 407,000 km (221,000 to 253,000 mi).": "月球繞地球的軌道不是正圓，因此幾週之內它會時遠時近。這裡的數值是所示時刻地心到月心的距離，大約介於 356,000 至 407,000 km（221,000 至 253,000 mi）之間。",
  "The UV index measures the strength of the sun’s ultraviolet radiation. The higher it is, the faster unprotected skin can burn. At 3 (moderate) and above, the World Health Organization advises shade, sunscreen, a hat and covering clothing.": "紫外線指數衡量太陽紫外線輻射的強度。數值越高，未做防護的皮膚越快曬傷。達到 3（中等）及以上時，世界衛生組織建議遮蔭、塗抹防曬乳、戴帽子並穿著遮蓋身體的衣物。",
  "The actual temperature.": "實際溫度。",
  "The air is clean, and nothing in it should bother anyone.": "空氣清潔，不會對任何人造成困擾。",
  "The average high is the mean high temperature for {date}, taken over a week either side, in every year since {since}. Monthly averages are the mean daily lows and highs of each month in those years.": "平均最高溫度是自 {since} 以來所有年份中，{date}前後各一週的最高溫度的平均值。每月平均值是這些年份中各月日最低與日最高溫度的平均值。",
  "The average humidity today is higher than yesterday.": "今天的平均濕度高於昨天。",
  "The average humidity today is lower than yesterday.": "今天的平均濕度低於昨天。",
  "The average humidity today is similar to yesterday.": "今天的平均濕度與昨天相近。",
  "The dew point is the temperature the air would need to cool to for dew to form. It tells you how humid the air feels better than relative humidity does: the higher it is, the muggier it feels.": "露點是空氣冷卻到開始凝結成露所需的溫度。它比相對濕度更能反映空氣的潮濕悶熱程度：露點越高，越覺得悶熱。",
  "The dew point is {dew} right now.": "目前露點為 {dew}。",
