  "The finest dust and soot in the air, small enough to get through the lungs into the blood. Most of it is smoke, from fires, engines and chimneys.": "空氣中最細的粉塵和煙塵，小到能穿過肺部進入血液。大部分是來自火災、引擎和煙囪的煙霧。",
  "The forecast has no hourly temperatures for this day.": "該日的預報沒有逐時溫度。",
