  "The normal range shows the most common temperatures for {date} since {since}, about 80% of them: at each hour, from the lowest tenth of that hour’s temperatures, a week either side of the date, to the highest tenth. Where today’s line is below the range, it is among the coldest tenth for its time of day; where it is above, among the warmest.": "正常範圍顯示自 {since} 以來 {date} 最常見的溫度，約占 80%：在每個小時，從該日前後各一週內該小時溫度中最低的十分之一，到最高的十分之一。今天的曲線低於該範圍時，屬於同一時段最冷的十分之一；高於該範圍時，屬於最暖的十分之一。",
