  "This air is starting to matter for anyone with heart or lung disease, and for older adults and children. Most other people should be fine.": "這種空氣已開始對心臟或肺部疾病患者、年長者和兒童造成影響。其他大多數人應該沒有問題。",
  "This is the share of the Moon’s visible face in sunlight at the moment shown, worked out from where it is in its monthly cycle: 0% at new moon and 100% at full. The card doesn’t look at the sky, so the figure is the same whether the Moon is up or set, and whatever the clouds are doing.": "這是所示時刻月球可見面被陽光照亮的比例，依據它在每月週期中的位置計算：新月時為 0%，滿月時為 100%。面板並不觀測天空，因此無論月亮在地平線上還是已落下，也無論雲況如何，數值都相同。",
  "This is the top of the scale. The air is dangerous for everyone, and the safest place is indoors with the windows shut.": "這是量表的最高級別。空氣對所有人都有危險，最安全的地方是門窗緊閉的室內。",
